  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v8.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "15f313c26a0c535aa043843259fe8c900fc202fabfe08fa340d1932bf89305dd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7ad30ee5a9b3f4266ea61dd68ef96169378308f4bf203a07d930d6bc6995d7f0",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nSlippy-Slide\nSkates",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43b0ae8665eb3e53a894ea7a3d85d2f4798bfba19d0000423cf8704e8c6e9ca0",
      "text": "Wukong watched them glide.\n“Look! Flying feet!”\n“I want to try!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9588e188ec9a7417ca96f8a864a6af1eb6647cd6739f48001bdc6bf7046af4ee",
      "text": "He put on his skates.\nClomp. Clomp.\n“My feet have tiny sleds!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a1c5746b6bfc5ce4c98b79f1e10c0c2ccce8618867dc141391363e5ebb2d73c",
      "text": "Helmet on. Mittens on.\nCoach Otter checked\nhis skates.\n“Ready for little steps?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef92f8b55e41717d14fb0b313f3e5057088bbbe7ad3a7d21304e2d24c843f148",
      "text": "Wukong stepped onto the ice.\nHis feet slid apart.\n“Wait for me, feet!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "af3cc9c816cbe538e0b6257416470c421f3c6345981243549d449a835e41745b",
      "text": "Whoops! Wukong fell down.\nHis bottom met the ice.\n“Hello, chilly floor.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "da02939d78d6d1df4bc564863d082682a1502b3aba0241d8a290c163401b4fb4",
      "text": "“Let’s practice,” said Coach\nOtter.\n“Let’s get up together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4156c45a24d3098acfb9ae9f16019cf90ac647d43d76cf3f4c302f4681b0e61d",
      "text": "Little steps. Bent knees.\n“Like a penguin!” said Jade.\nWukong stepped and giggled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fad26fd35f0d99cfd52dcad77f08b06435f1b4e5929142c057b61fcd1017fd0b",
      "text": "Push… glide.\nPush… glide.\nOne tiny slide!\nThen another.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "07c248855c664a60e6f55b2a3e53598c2b35c43c9237225edb8e911626913092",
      "text": "Then came another tumble.\n“Oh! I fell down again.”\nHe sat beside Pigsy.\n“Rest with me,” said Pigsy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "191ad9a8ec4e69034c14f9dafb42b194c0843726baab51a509a77a69a05594b5",
      "text": "They warmed their hands.\nThey watched the snow.\n“I’ll try again,” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0ef690ea6e42c9938f2d1b014d20c85e392e69410dc0af21f75bb898c949451b",
      "text": "He came back to practice.\nA small step. A slow glide.\nHe wobbled, but kept going.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f167e2513ba3eaee8a43f3f5de03280563fb3fc169a7a5b9171688f1b926e87e",
      "text": "Then he could glide a little.\nPush... glide.\nPush... glide.\n“Look! I’m doing it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90ed423c0ac08f717e6ccc762e09b52720688a3019e4be21a74eeae7dd5e3ce1",
      "text": "They made a gentle circle.\nJade led. Pigsy followed.\nWukong glided along.\nSix happy skates!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d53bba0d6d774757d633688f601913977e2b8d7f183f165f77257ca998f69e5",
      "text": "The rink lights twinkled.\n“See you soon, ice!”\nHis feet were tired.\nHis smile was not.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08f7e21e3fb880b22e8cbf4b1700b4d5bf70b97b732954a13d488e836ccdabd6",
      "text": "Wukong pulled up his blanket.\nHe dreamed of gliding past\nstars.\nSlowly. Softly.\nOff to sleep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
